+- **Owner invariant:** ownership lives on `entity_memberships.role`, not on a circular FK. A stored generated column `owner_seq` is `1` when `role = 'owner'` and `NULL` otherwise; the unique index `entity_memberships_one_owner` on `(entity_id, owner_seq)` lets both SQLite and MariaDB allow any number of non-owners while rejecting a second owner. Ownership transfer demotes the current owner before promoting the target, inside one transaction.
